{"4291000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Human Remains", "steam_appid": 4291000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human Remains</strong> plunges you into <strong>New Harmony</strong>, a night-shrouded American city devastated by a biological disaster. You begin your journey <strong>waking from amnesia in a hospital overrun by zombies and full of mysteries</strong>. Step into the shoes of <strong>Dorian Hale</strong> as he navigates a hostile world, uncovers dark secrets, and searches desperately for his brother Samuel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Dorian’s tragic story as a devoted brother and desperate survivor. Interact with other survivors, some helpful, some dangerous. Some choices are minor, while others carry significant consequences that can shape key moments of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies and grotesque creatures using an arsenal of firearms—pistols, shotguns, and assault rifles. Craft tools and items to improve your chances and adapt your strategy to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6468b44b6d8c31559f91d1e4e9e2cf71.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6468b44b6d8c31559f91d1e4e9e2cf71.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6468b44b6d8c31559f91d1e4e9e2cf71.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined streets, buildings, and key locations in New Harmony. Solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and investigate the mysteries surrounding the disaster and your brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/f0000bc0ca4647fc9e26ba311cd95955.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/f0000bc0ca4647fc9e26ba311cd95955.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/f0000bc0ca4647fc9e26ba311cd95955.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6d3b7dbdb29990cb82b666f360ba4d98.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6d3b7dbdb29990cb82b666f360ba4d98.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6d3b7dbdb29990cb82b666f360ba4d98.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/7271aad3165a925d99b4bec7290ff0bf.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/7271aad3165a925d99b4bec7290ff0bf.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/7271aad3165a925d99b4bec7290ff0bf.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere &amp; Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic third-person gameplay with high-fidelity graphics, detailed environments, atmospheric lighting, and a chilling soundtrack that enhances every tense moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/2dba40879db9101a3eb907c24dc98964.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/2dba40879db9101a3eb907c24dc98964.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/2dba40879db9101a3eb907c24dc98964.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions throughout the game can influence relationships and pivotal moments, offering multiple outcomes and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human Remains</strong> plunges you into <strong>New Harmony</strong>, a night-shrouded American city devastated by a biological disaster. You begin your journey <strong>waking from amnesia in a hospital overrun by zombies and full of mysteries</strong>. Step into the shoes of <strong>Dorian Hale</strong> as he navigates a hostile world, uncovers dark secrets, and searches desperately for his brother Samuel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Dorian’s tragic story as a devoted brother and desperate survivor. Interact with other survivors, some helpful, some dangerous. Some choices are minor, while others carry significant consequences that can shape key moments of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.poster.avif?t=1772188572\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.webm?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/457134fa8b16d6bceeb369a793945c2b.mp4?t=1772188572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies and grotesque creatures using an arsenal of firearms—pistols, shotguns, and assault rifles. Craft tools and items to improve your chances and adapt your strategy to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291000/extras/6468b44b6d8c31559f91d1e4e9e2cf71.poster.avif?t=1